; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Bounac\">Bounac</a> throne room.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tFights in close combat. Fugue never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tFugue is similar in strength to <a href=\"#/wiki/Grand%20Master%20Oberon\">Grand Master Oberon</a>, though its many summons can make the fight more dangerous. For a small team or even a duo with a blocker and healer it isn't very complicated and should be rather straightforward damage dealing. \n</p><p>Without a blocker, or at lower levels (&lt;400), a good strategy is to pull Fugue outside of the room and close the door, protecting yourself from the Usurpers. After that, you can also use the stairs to go down in case of an emergency or to heal your <a href=\"#/wiki/Familiars\">Special Summon</a>, if using it. \n</p><p>Bear in mind that Fugue disappears if it's not killed a few minutes after it spawns, which can hinder the solo strategy with stair-hopping ineffective.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Approximately a week after Fugue was launched as part of the Summer Update 2020 it became common knowledge that his spawning mechanic could be used to farm his loot. By forcing his spawn several times, without completing the quest, players could kill an indefinite amount of Fugues, which dropped good loot in a Reward Container, including parts of the Lion Set. On July 19, 2020, CipSoft made an emergency downtime and removed Fugue's loot. \n</p><p>On the following week, it was announced that players who excessively farmed this mechanic would be punished. This punishment consisted of an immediate two days of Banishment for destructive behavior, as well as being unable to log in for three days during the upcoming <a href=\"#/wiki/Double%20Loot%20Events\">Double Loot Event</a>. In total, over 1500 accounts were punished for this, according to CipSoft. Nevertheless, no items, gold or Tibia Coins were removed from the characters, which were allowed to keep the loot obtained. \n</p><p>Finally, on August 21, 2020, CipSoft confirmed that the loot removal would be permanent.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 1 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Members_of_the_Order_of_the_Lion\">Members of the Order of the Lion</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Lion%20Archer\">Ancient Lion Archer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Lion%20Knight\">Ancient Lion Knight</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Lion%20Warlock\">Ancient Lion Warlock</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Drume\">Drume</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hardened%20Usurper%20Archer\">Hardened Usurper Archer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hardened%20Usurper%20Knight\">Hardened Usurper Knight</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hardened%20Usurper%20Warlock\">Hardened Usurper Warlock</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kesar\">Kesar</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%20Archer\">Lion Archer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%20Commander\">Lion Commander</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%20Knight\">Lion Knight</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%20Warlock\">Lion Warlock</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Monk%20of%20the%20Order\">Monk of the Order</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Usurper%20Archer\">Usurper Archer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Usurper%20Commander\">Usurper Commander</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Usurper%20Knight\">Usurper Knight</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Usurper%20Warlock\">Usurper Warlock</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[]}